          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You play out battles in your head, allowing you to Strike when the time is right. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Devise a Stratagem]{Devise a Strategem} action; however, when you substitute its result for your attack roll, you can't use your Intelligence modifier in place of your Strength or Dexterity modifier.</p>\n<p>You also can't use your Intelligence modifier on other rolls from abilities that expand Devise a Stratagem, such as the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Athletic Strategist] feat.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
